Language data
=============

language-samples.json retains the fixed language samples and per-entry source
attribution previously maintained at the site directory root. It includes
Pango samples, Fontconfig orthographies and project-maintained alternatives.

language-names.json records the Simplified Chinese labels from the existing
catalog: Babel/CLDR names plus the project's historical-language and Chinese
regional overrides. New language tags need a reviewed Chinese name and sample.
CLDR: https://cldr.unicode.org/ (Unicode data license).
